WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.840
I refuse to keep living
like I didn't matter.

00:00:04.260 --> 00:00:05.240
Let me say that again.

00:00:06.040 --> 00:00:09.200
It was because I refuse to keep living
like I didn't matter.

00:00:11.760 --> 00:00:15.820
And maybe that's where transformation
really begins. Not when everything changes,

00:00:16.340 --> 00:00:18.940
but when you finally believe you can.

00:00:24.290 --> 00:00:28.690
So, when I look back over everything,
everything that I went through,
the health scares,

00:00:28.890 --> 00:00:31.390
the family struggles,
the silent battles in my mind,

00:00:32.150 --> 00:00:38.390
I realized something that changed my life:
that pain wasn't just something
I had to get through.

00:00:38.750 --> 00:00:40.770
It was something I had to learn from.

00:00:41.110 --> 00:00:45.690
Because pain sometimes doesn't come
to just destroy you,
but it comes to develop you.
